    {
      "text": "Electrodynamics and the Gauss linking integral on the 3-sphere and in hyperbolic 3-space — 64 sections: Front matter; ORGANIZATION; STATEMENTS OF RESULTS\n\n**Electrodynamics and the Gauss linking integral on the 3-sphere and in hyperbolic 3-space**\n\n*Dennis DeTurck and Herman Gluck*\n\n108 pp, 64 sections.\n\n**Outline.** Front matter; ORGANIZATION; A STATEMENTS OF RESULTS; 1 Linking integrals in R3 , S3 and H3 .; 2 The route to Gauss's linking integral.; 3 Magnetic fields in R3 , S3 and H3 .; 4 Left-invariant vector fields on S3 .; 5 Scalar-valued Green's operators in R3 , S3 a; 6 Vector-valued Green's operators in R3 , S3 a; 7 Classical electrodynamics and Maxwell's equa; B PROOFS ON S3 IN LEFT-TRANSLATION FORMAT; 8 Proof scheme for Theorem 3, formula (1).; 9 The calculus of vector convolutions in R3 .; 10 The calculus of vector convolutions in S3 .; 11 Proof of Theorem 3, formula (1).; 12 Proof of Theorem 2, formula (1).; C PROOFS ON S3 IN PARALLEL TRANSPORT FORMAT; 13 Parallel transport in S3 .",
